          "role": "known-context-not-new-discovery"
        },
        {
          "cell": "10A.43!C59",
          "text": "Collection of data in very remote areas of Australia was phased out part way through the Patient Experience Survey 2023-24 cycle. From 2024-25, people resident in very remote areas of Australia were excluded from the survey.",
